#gras{PUBLISHED ON JULY 6, 2018}#gras{PLEASE READ THIS PRIVACY POLICY CAREFULLY}

Welcome to EUGEN SYSTEMS, a French video game company. This Privacy Policy explains our privacy commitment to our players and users of our Services (hereinafter "#gras1{Users}"). This Privacy Policy is incorporated as part of the EUGEN SYSTEMS Terms of Use, accessible at [https://www.eugensystems.com].
 At EUGEN SYSTEMS, we collect personal data to support our products and services, while respecting all applicable laws, including but not limited to the Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA), and regulation (EU) 2016/679 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 27 April 2016, directly applicable from May, 25th, 2018 (hereinafter, "General Data Protection Regulation", or "GDPR"). As defined in the GDPR, "personal data" means any information relating to an identified or identifiable natural person, directly or indirectly, in particular by reference to an identifier such as a name, an identification number, location data, an online identifier or to one or more factors specific to the physical, physiological, genetic, mental, economic, cultural or social identity of that natural person.By using EUGEN SYSTEMS’s services, you authorize EUGEN SYSTEMS SA to process your personal data according to this Privacy Policy. If you do not accept the terms of this Privacy Policy, please refrain from using our online games or our games’ online functionalities, our websites, our mobile apps and any other online EUGEN SYSTEMS products and services (hereinafter "#gras1{Services}").In accordance with this Privacy Policy, the Data controller is EUGEN SYSTEMS SA, with its headquarters at 151 rue Saint Denis, 75002, Paris, France.

